{"id":4698,"slug":"termo-de-licitacao-0001-26","title":{"rendered":"Termo de licita\u00e7\u00e3o 0001\/26"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column sesc-section is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:75%\">\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>CONSULTA P\u00daBLICA SESC\/DN N\u00ba 0001\/26-CP<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">ADENDOS II, III E IV<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong><u>RESPOSTAS\u00a0A\u00a0QUESTIONAMENTO<\/u><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">S<\/span><\/strong><br><strong><u>VIDE ARQUIVOS ANEXOS.<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Rio de Janeiro, 15\u00a0maio\u00a0de 2026.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong><u>ADENDO I<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>O DEPARTAMENTO NACIONAL DO SERVI\u00c7O SOCIAL DO COM\u00c9RCIO &#8211; SESC, INFORMA AS SEGUINTES ALTERA\u00c7\u00d5ES FEITAS AO ITEM 7 DA CONSULTA P\u00daBLICA DO EDITAL:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><u>7.&nbsp;CRONOGRAMA DA CONSULTA P\u00daBLICA<\/u><\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong> <strong>ETAPA<\/strong><strong><\/strong> <strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>PRAZO<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>&nbsp; &nbsp;Pedidos de esclarecimentos sobre a Consulta P\u00fablica&nbsp; &nbsp;<\/td><td>At\u00e9&nbsp;13\/05\/2026<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>&nbsp; &nbsp;Publica\u00e7\u00e3o das respostas aos pedidos de esclarecimentos &nbsp;<\/td><td>At\u00e9&nbsp;15\/05\/2026<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>&nbsp; &nbsp;Prazo para envio das sugest\u00f5es\/contribui\u00e7\u00f5es&nbsp; &nbsp;<\/td><td>At\u00e9&nbsp;20\/05\/2026<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><br>Rio de Janeiro, 07 de maio de 2026<br><br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>CONSULTA P\u00daBLICA SESC\/DN N\u00ba 0001\/26-CP<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>EDITAL DE CONVOCA\u00c7\u00c3O<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>O Departamento Nacional do SERVI\u00c7O SOCIAL DO COM\u00c9RCIO &#8211; SESC, entidade de direito privado, sem fins lucrativos, comunica a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da&nbsp;<strong>CONSULTA&nbsp;P\u00daBLICA SESC\/DN N\u00ba 0001\/26-CP<\/strong>,&nbsp;regida pelo Regulamento de Licita\u00e7\u00f5es e Contratos do Sesc, consolidado pela\u202f<strong>Resolu\u00e7\u00e3o Sesc n\u00ba 1.593\/2024\u202f<\/strong>de\u202f<strong>02\/05\/2024<\/strong>,&nbsp;destinada \u00e0 colher subs\u00eddios para consolida\u00e7\u00e3o de vers\u00e3o final&nbsp;do Termo de Refer\u00eancia para&nbsp;futura licita\u00e7\u00e3o visando o&nbsp;<strong>Registro de Pre\u00e7os para contrata\u00e7\u00e3o de empresa especializada para o licenciamento e implanta\u00e7\u00e3o de solu\u00e7\u00e3o de software em modelo SaaS (Software as a&nbsp;Service) de Gerenciamento de Relacionamento com o Cliente (CRM)<\/strong>,&nbsp;proporcionando oportunidade aos eventuais interessados para se manifestarem, mediante o encaminhamento pr\u00e9vio de questionamentos e contribui\u00e7\u00f5es, de acordo com as condi\u00e7\u00f5es estabelecidas neste Edital e anexos.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>A presente Consulta P\u00fablica tem como finalidade tornar mais transparente o futuro procedimento licitat\u00f3rio e, ainda, garantir as melhores condi\u00e7\u00f5es e exig\u00eancias poss\u00edveis existentes no mercado para a execu\u00e7\u00e3o eficiente e eficaz do objeto, por meio de questionamentos, esclarecimentos e sugest\u00f5es.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Integram o presente Edital de Consulta P\u00fablica os seguintes anexos:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>ANEXO I &#8211; Termo de Refer\u00eancia;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>ANEXO II \u2013 Modelo de Proposta; e&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>ANEXO III \u2013 Prova de Conceito (POC).&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Rio de Janeiro, 28 de abril de 2026<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column sesc-section is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Anexos<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n                <div class=\"igd igd-shortcode-wrap igd-shortcode-browser\"\n                     data-shortcode-data=\"\\\\\/dXNwPWRyaXZlc2RrIiwid2ViQ29udGVudExpbmsiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvZHJpdmUuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbVwvdWM\\\/dXNwPWRyaXZlc2RrIiwid2ViQ29udGVudExpbmsiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvZHJpdmUuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbVwvdWM\\\\"\n                     style=\"--module-width: 100%; --module-height: ;\"\n                ><\/div>\n                <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false}}